---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Leo"
  description="Meet Leo, the founder behind RankwithLeo and your direct partner for Agentic SEO, content and website growth work."
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <section class="wrap about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="about-hero-copy">
        <h1 id="about-title">
          <span class="about-line" style="--word-delay: 0ms">Reach the <strong>right customers.</strong></span>
          <span class="about-line" style="--word-delay: 70ms">Give them a reason to <strong>choose you.</strong></span>
          <span class="about-line" style="--word-delay: 140ms">Build with <strong>Leo.</strong></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="about-intro">I’m Leo, founder of RankwithLeo. I connect Agentic SEO, useful content and clear websites around your business goals: attracting relevant prospects, building confidence in your offer and making it easier to enquire. You work directly with me—from deciding what matters to putting the plan into practice.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="/contact/">Book a Strategy Call</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/work/">See Selected Work</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="about-portrait">
        <img src="/assets/plates/about-leo-ai-studio.png" alt="Leo in an illustrative studio with AI workflow symbols, code and search tools behind him" width="1122" height="1402" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption>Human-led strategy. AI-supported delivery. Illustrative studio portrait.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap about-outcomes" aria-labelledby="outcomes-title">
      <header>
        <h2 id="outcomes-title">What working together should give you.</h2>
        <p>Not another pile of ideas. A useful direction, work that moves and a person who stays accountable.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="about-outcome-list">
        <div>
          <h3><strong>Clear</strong> priorities</h3>
          <p>See what matters now, why it matters and what can wait—before time is spent on the wrong task.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Work that gets <strong>implemented</strong></h3>
          <p>Connect research to useful pages, content and technical improvements instead of leaving the strategy in a report.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>One partner <strong>accountable</strong></h3>
          <p>Work directly with me through the priorities, decisions and delivery, with a clear view of what happens next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap about-working" aria-labelledby="working-title">
      <h2 id="working-title">Built around <strong>your business.</strong></h2>
      <div>
        <p>I use Codex to help with research, analysis and implementation. It supports the work; it does not replace my judgment or responsibility for quality.</p>
        <p>I work with businesses worldwide, with particular experience across trades, recruitment and outsourcing. We begin with your audience, your current website and the business outcome you need it to support.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore how I can help</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap about-close" aria-labelledby="about-close-title">
      <div>
        <h2 id="about-close-title">Bring the business problem. We’ll find the right starting point.</h2>
        <p>You do not need a perfect brief. Tell me what feels stuck and what a better outcome would look like.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk About Your Business</a>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
